==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*5 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**2 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**1 [[Zigge]] spawns.

==Strategy==
All of the zombies are weakened, so using anti-Zombie units like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]], [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat]] and [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Lumbercat]] will be more useful. You may also use Welterweight Cat if you are having trouble with Zombies that burrowed past your units. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] and other anti-Dark units can take care of the Gory Darks and the Doge Darks.

